# PPR.2D (ADR 0074 section 28.5): Terraform state, plans, provider caches and
# variable values never enter Git. State is Highly Sensitive (ADR 0050 section
# 18) and lives only in the per-environment remote backend.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
*.tfplan.*
.terraform/
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
